stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> uploaded : app writes the memory
  uploaded --> processing : ingestion trigger starts
  processing --> embedding : text read and chunked
  processing --> extracted : nothing readable,<br/>unsupported type or over quota
  embedding --> ready : chunks written, file kept
  processing --> failed : error
  embedding --> failed : error
  failed --> processing : reindex sweep, every 6 h
  ready --> [*]
  note right of extracted
    Kept in the library, not searchable.
    indexNote says why.
  end note
  note left of failed
    error text and
    errorRetryable flag
  end note
  classDef good fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#15803D,color:#0F172A
  classDef hold fill:#FEF9C3,stroke:#A16207,color:#0F172A
  classDef bad fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#B91C1C,color:#0F172A
  classDef step fill:#EFF6FF,stroke:#2563EB,color:#0F172A
  class ready good
  class extracted hold
  class failed bad
  class uploaded,processing,embedding step
